# Build context for flowhq/Dockerfile (built from the repository root). Keep host dependencies, build output, secrets and
# unrelated apps out: the image installs its own node_modules, and no .env or users.json may ever end up in a build layer.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/users.json
backups
*.tar.gz
*.enc
apps
docs
grist
privacy-policy.html
